/*
Instantiations of the operator macros defined in mathoperators.i.

Generated by enumeration over the dimension grid rather than written by hand -- every matrix
from 1x1 to 6x6, plus the two larger square types the navigation filters already publish
through DataIO. A %extend has to precede the %template that instantiates it, so the whole
operator set is declared first and the templates follow at the end.
*/

/* ---- element access, arithmetic and comparison ---- */
WT_MATRIX_METHODS(1, 1)
WT_MATRIX_METHODS(1, 2)
WT_MATRIX_METHODS(1, 3)
